    ✔ free text, unknown names, a service or clinician field, bad links and condition-revealing location names never reach a notification (TC-NT-06) (13.829812ms)
    ✔ dedupe keys prevent double sends: a repeat creates nothing and queues nothing, also under concurrency (158.03409ms)
    ✔ a rolled-back business transaction leaves no notification and no job; a delayed send waits for send_after (31.939396ms)
    ✔ cancel by dedupe-key prefix cancels queued rows of that resource only; sent rows are final (99.496843ms)
