    ✔ inserts: a patient only for themselves, queued only; admin realm only to principals; a worker needs its patients scope (54.640846ms)
    ✔ the application role cannot change content, delete, or touch receipts; receipts and reads are append-only (11.698402ms)
    ✔ table rules: dedupe key without the recipient, recipient kind consistent, values on the allowlist, forward-only status (10.600121ms)
